                                            "Synonym of apartment building: any building comprising apartments."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1554195f-8028-48d4-8ab2-f164a6c423ab",
                                                "sense_id": "2d8576d6-d4db-3f7d-8c25-c9300458ab15",
                                                "text": "Heritage House is a ten-story apartment house for seniors in the heart of downtown."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e9289ee-005a-346a-aab6-69a61bffe588",
                                        "entry_id": "b0132261-d9d8-3969-b27f-7a9061e9a677",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A house comparable in size to a single-family house but comprising several apartments; typically not more than two or three stories tall and containing a single-digit number of apartments (such as two to six)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32cf2bdf-b03b-42be-aeb4-314c2c638381",
                                                "sense_id": "0e9289ee-005a-346a-aab6-69a61bffe588",
                                                "text": "Armitage House is a stately old home on Main Street; it was built in the 1910s as the private home of a local factory owner, and years later it was converted into a trendy apartment house. [tour bus banter]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
